#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:4
msgid "EBNF-Guided Generation"
msgstr "EBNF引导的生成"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:6
msgid ""
"XGrammar enables efficient structured generation. Besides JSON, you can "
"use an EBNF grammar to guide the generation, providing more flexibility "
"for customization."
msgstr ""
"XGrammar 支持高效的结构化生成。除了 JSON 之外，你还可以使用 EBNF 语法来指导生成过程，从而提供更大的定制灵活性。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:9
msgid ""
"We first go over how to use XGrammar in an LLM engine to achieve this in "
":ref:`EBNF-Guided Generation in LLM Engines <how-to-ebnf-generation-"
"engine>`, we then provide an end-to-end JSON generation using XGrammar "
"with HF ``transformers`` in :ref:`Try out via HF Transformers <how-to-"
"ebnf-generation-HF>`."
msgstr ""
"首先回顾如何在 LLM 引擎中使用 XGrammar 来实现这一功能，详见 :ref:`LLM引擎中的EBNF引导生成 <how-to-ebnf-generation-engine>`，"
"随后提供了端到端的示例，展示如何结合 HF 的 ``transformers`` 库使用 XGrammar 进行 JSON 生成，"
"详见 :ref:`通过HF Transformers尝试 <how-to-ebnf-generation-HF>`。"

