#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:24
msgid "EBNF-Guided Generation in LLM Engines"
msgstr "LLM 引擎中的 EBNF 引导生成"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:26
msgid ""
"In this section, we see how to use XGrammar in an LLM engine to ensure "
"that the output follows ane EBNF grammar."
msgstr ""
"在本节中，将探讨如何在 LLM 引擎中使用 XGrammar，以确保输出遵循 EBNF 语法。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:29
#: ../../how_to/json_generation.rst:30
msgid ""
"All code snippets below are actual runnable code as we simulate the LLM "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"以下所有代码片段均为实际可运行的代码，因为模拟了 LLM 生成过程。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:31
#: ../../how_to/engine_integration.rst:31 ../../how_to/json_generation.rst:32
msgid "First, import necessary libraries for the tutorial."
msgstr "首先，为本教程导入必要的库。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:40
#: ../../how_to/json_generation.rst:41
msgid ""
"Then, we extract tokenizer info from the LLM we are using with "
"``xgr.TokenizerInfo``. With the ``tokenizer_info``, instantiate "
"``xgr.GrammarCompiler`` that will compiler a grammar of your choice."
msgstr ""
"接着，从正在使用的大型语言模型（LLM）中提取分词器信息，"
"使用 ``xgr.TokenizerInfo``。有了 ``tokenizer_info`` 之后，实例化 ``xgr.GrammarCompiler``，它将编译您选择的语法。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:56
msgid ""
"Then specify an EBNF grammar string. We currently use the GBNF format "
"(GGML BNF), with the specification `here "
"<https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp/blob/master/grammars/README.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"随后，指定 EBNF 语法字符串。目前采用 GBNF 格式"
"（GGML BNF），其规范可参见 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp/blob/master/grammars/README.md>`__.。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:70
#: ../../how_to/json_generation.rst:97
msgid ""
"With the compiled grammar, we can instantiate a ``xgr.GrammarMatcher``, "
"the main construct we interact with that maintains the state of the "
"structured generation. We also allocate a bitmask that will be used to "
"mask logits."
msgstr ""
"利用编译好的语法，可以实例化 ``xgr.GrammarMatcher``，"
"这是我们与之交互的主要结构，它维护着结构化生成的状态。还会分配位掩码，"
"该掩码将用于对逻辑单元（logits）进行掩码处理。"

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:80
#: ../../how_to/json_generation.rst:107
msgid ""
"Now we simulate a single-request auto-regressive generation. See :ref"
":`how-to-engine-integration` for batched inference."
msgstr ""
"现在模拟单请求的自回归生成过程。关于批量推理，请参阅 :ref:`how-to-engine-integration`。"

